{"id":"xtnzmjrume0lfb3rckl80gp0t","title":"雷根斯堡大学团队在 Nature 报道石墨烯电子跃迁可视化突破","originalTitle":"科学家第一次直接拍下电子“上高架”的视频","summary":"雷根斯堡大学、马尔堡大学及于利希研究中心首次通过超快成像技术直接观测到石墨烯中电子跃迁过程。实验采用两束光：强中红外光推动电子运动，极紫外光捕捉瞬态图像。研究显示，电子在强光作用下沿光场方向形成拉长椭圆分布，证实了 Landau–Zener–Majorana 跃迁机制。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"知识分子"},"links":{"original":"http://www.zhishifenzi.com/news/multiple/10771.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-15T19:52:39.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T17:00:03.467Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T17:00:03.467Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","Nature"],"score":57,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"4a85c294-a0cd-43fb-9777-97c04b56457b","title":"Regensburg大学团队通过超快成像首次观测石墨烯电子量子跃迁"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"4a85c294-a0cd-43fb-9777-97c04b56457b","title":"Regensburg大学团队通过超快成像首次观测石墨烯电子量子跃迁"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fGcEijqsFtZY","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}